-- DESIGN.md §4.6-4.9: Category (Singletons, FromTotal, Objects.singl-prop:
-- univalence from total spaces; Descent's Singl now lives here),
-- FunctorUnivalence (Fun(B,E) a category), EquivObjects (the corollary),
-- CompletionUP.Instance.Universal.equiv.  Kinds as above, plus the notions
-- of §4.7 (Total, Obj, Maps, MapIdn, MapComp, Laws, Rest, S, Fib) and
-- "by definition" of component, rebuilt, functor, G, r, s, lifted, and of
-- fun-D, fun-C (whose pre is FunCat.pre).
